cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, its data or its results, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "dotwire vs Tinode: realtime chat server benchmark (dotwire 0.4.1, Tinode 0.25.3)"
abstract: >-
  Open-loop benchmark harness, raw results and case-study notebook comparing the
  dotwire realtime chat server (0.4.1, with a 0.4.0 baseline) against Tinode 0.25.3
  on two Hetzner Cloud CCX33 servers: latency ladder, fan-out, connections,
  reconnect storm and history reads. An untuned Synapse attempt is included as an
  appendix and excluded from every comparison.
authors:
